-- WoW Forever: Forever quests from the 25 Nov check that were held for missing NPCs, objects or quest items (kit A of the
-- held quests; the quests themselves follow 2026_11_25_40). 35 quests with their full live record, plus what they need:
-- 16 NPC templates (6 of them invisible kill-credit entries that the quests' own items credit), 21 object templates,
-- 226 NPC and 368 object spawns on Mount Hyjal, Azshara, Winterspring, Shen'dralas, Arathi Highlands and Un'Goro Crater,
-- and the quest item drops.
-- NPC and object records and quest records: Data from Efficient Games (https://efficient.games), licensed under CC BY 4.0
-- (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Source: github.com/JIVESCORP/eg-link-output-wowf creature_details,
-- object_details, quests.enUS, texts.enUS, npcs. Changed: picked and converted to our tables.
-- Spawn points, levels, reactions and NPC models where EG Link has none: Wowhead Forever NPC and object pages (map points).
-- Which NPC or object drops each quest item and how often, quest givers and turn-ins, kill-credit NPC names:
-- Icy Veins WoW Forever database (db.icy-veins.com/wow-forever), checked against Wowhead.
-- Spawn heights: our own map data (.playerbot groundz on the dev realm). Guids 47620000-47621999.
-- Safe to run again: every row is replaced by key.

